%T A398672 274758382276,3826890587536,53301709843204,742397047217296,
%U A398672 10340256951198916,144021200269567504,2005956546822746116,27939370455248878096,389145229826661547204,5420093847118012782736
%N A398672 Number of domino tilings (perfect matchings) of the 4 X 2n grid graph embedded on the Klein bottle.
%C A398672 The 4 X 2n grid graph is embedded on the Klein bottle by making the vertical direction (length 4) periodic and the horizontal direction (length 2n) antiperiodic with a twist that reverses the vertical coordinate. Equivalently, the top and bottom sides (each of length 2n) are identified periodically (forming a cylinder of circumference 4), and the two ends of the cylinder (each a circle of length 4) are identified with a twist.
%C A398672 The characteristic polynomial of the order-3 recurrence is x^3 - 15*x^2 + 15*x - 1 = (x - 1)*(x^2 - 14*x + 1). The dominant root is 7 + 4*sqrt(3) = (2 + sqrt(3))^2 ~13.928, which determines the asymptotic growth rate.
%C A398672 This sequence is related to A011922. Both sequences share the same characteristic polynomial but have different initial conditions. Specifically, a(n) = 6*A011922(n) - 2.
%D A398672 M. Bóna (ed.), Handbook of Enumerative Combinatorics, CRC Press / Chapman & Hall, 2015. (Transfer matrix method for tiling enumeration).
%H A398672 <a href="/index/Rec#order_03">Index entries for linear recurrences with constant coefficients</a>, signature (15,-15,1).
%F A398672 a(n) = 15*a(n-1) - 15*a(n-2) + a(n-3) for n >= 4, with a(1) = 16, a(2) = 196, a(3) = 2704.
%F A398672 G.f.: 4*x*(x^2 - 11*x + 4) / (1 - 15*x + 15*x^2 - x^3).
%e A398672 For n=1, the 4 X 2 grid on the Klein bottle has a(1) = 16 perfect matchings.
%e A398672 For n=2, the 4 X 4 grid on the Klein bottle has a(2) = 196 perfect matchings.
%o A398672 (Python)
%o A398672 def A_list(N):
%o A398672     seq = [16, 196, 2704]
%o A398672     for n in range(4, N + 1):
%o A398672         seq.append(15*seq[-1] - 15*seq[-2] + seq[-3])
%o A398672     return seq[:N]
%Y A398672 Cf. A011922.
%K A398672 nonn,easy,new
%O A398672 1,1
